{"event_type":"review","id":"cf51a9080fc4c1cda0852058db2ca4ecc8fb90df532524c1c31df5b101455a2d","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T02:50:26Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/769c7f1adcd2921e04ba71db467e5f7b45b49badad96e8a3b3c8c0b9f123dbb2","sha256":"769c7f1adcd2921e04ba71db467e5f7b45b49badad96e8a3b3c8c0b9f123dbb2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bf04e5d060ba9b7ca4ffc3c027fa69e732d63b47e76cec15f9979e66a886f486","sha256":"bf04e5d060ba9b7ca4ffc3c027fa69e732d63b47e76cec15f9979e66a886f486"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f09d9936ff5c0cb710794d2c280e9ae9d231183256fd2c0c342591c4d3deba56","sha256":"f09d9936ff5c0cb710794d2c280e9ae9d231183256fd2c0c342591c4d3deba56"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/64257b5e7f21ee299ba72d48aa26e4e18d19d34888ecedf5628b7b016812f075","sha256":"64257b5e7f21ee299ba72d48aa26e4e18d19d34888ecedf5628b7b016812f075"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0d44b179771334ac969b1c7fe37a33ec03fe0c5f47454db13f8b47840d9ee7be","sha256":"0d44b179771334ac969b1c7fe37a33ec03fe0c5f47454db13f8b47840d9ee7be"}],"attempt_id":"73cd39d71ff326da8bfe286e9dcc58f96cab64fa3931992a70350e2dace4c99d:0:1","base":"deb68ceb3dd56d9545cb61ade8ab609fbb5f8158","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"f78aeaf3451efbf3809f9064c6867f42029bab38","body":"**Fix the `events()` doc comment: in memory-only mode the snapshot is not durable.**\n\nAt observation.ts:102-103 the comment says the snapshot is \"Durable in both modes\". The same comment then says that without a `journalDir` this snapshot is the only copy, with persistence `'unavailable'`. The file header at observation.ts:13-16 states the writer \"never claims durability\" in memory-only mode. T30/T31 will build report rows from this contract, so the wording must not imply durability. In durable mode the actual guarantee is narrower: an event enters `accepted` only after its `writeFile` and `datasync` succeed (observation.ts:266-269).\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Proposed doc fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n   /**\n-   * Snapshot of the validated events this writer accepted. Durable in both\n-   * modes; without a journalDir this is the ONLY copy (persistence\n-   * unavailable), so T30/T31 can build report rows from it.\n+   * Snapshot of the validated events this writer accepted, available in both\n+   * modes. Durable mode lists only events whose bytes and datasync succeeded;\n+   * without a journalDir this is the ONLY copy (persistence unavailable), so\n+   * T30/T31 can build report rows from it.\n    */\n```\n</details>","id":"b9d15f6bc9c5deb8eb953f4f3f34af066497c63634fc902e8a6a609cc129a8d6","intervals":[],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Fix the `events()` doc comment: in memory-only mode the snapshot is not durable."}],"head":"1765d4baccd97403cea50818566cca4291559284","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"f78aeaf3451efbf3809f9064c6867f42029bab38","intervals":[[1,519]],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts"},{"blob":"cdc5479eae351a06a0429562e10c0c41b5ccb325","intervals":[[1,1107]],"path":"src/kernel/types.ts"}],"job_id":"73cd39d71ff326da8bfe286e9dcc58f96cab64fa3931992a70350e2dace4c99d:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"f78aeaf3451efbf3809f9064c6867f42029bab38","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/kernel/observation.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"cdc5479eae351a06a0429562e10c0c41b5ccb325","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/kernel/types.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72ec